## 2. 測試與驗證結果 (Test Results)

### 2.1 單元與整合測試套件（10 套 75 題全數通過）
```
$ node tests/model.test.js && node tests/shot.test.js && node tests/keeperAI.test.js && node tests/input.test.js && node tests/difficulty.test.js && node tests/takerAI.test.js && node tests/taunts.test.js && node tests/match_integration.test.js && node tests/tournament.test.js && node tests/unlocks.test.js

--- Running PenaltyMindModel Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Initial state: uniform-ish distribution and 0 predictability
✅ PASS: Learns repeated pattern: after 10x always "top-left" (TL), predicts TL with highest probability
✅ PASS: Entropy score behaves: uniform distribution has low predictability, repeated has high
✅ PASS: Predictability score reflects sequence learning: TL/BR alternation scores high, uniform transitions stay low
✅ PASS: Learns N-gram alternating pattern: TL -> BR -> TL -> BR
✅ PASS: Probabilities always sum to 1.0 and are non-negative
✅ PASS: Dive zone selection returns valid zone and respects probabilities
✅ PASS: Heatmap and accuracy calculation
✅ PASS: Export and import state preserves all data
✅ PASS: Tied probabilities: fair dive sampling and no fake prediction
✅ PASS: Draw match result and sanitization against invalid data
✅ PASS: Sequence predictability resilience: 15x alternating TL/BR + 1 TM retains high sequence predictability
✅ PASS: Predictability score requires >= 8 shots, returns null / 數據不足 otherwise
✅ PASS: Five distinct varied zones yields low predictability (< 30)
All 14 / 14 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Shot Physics (src/shot.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Swipe straight up -> centre target and valid goal crossing
✅ PASS: Faster swipe -> higher speed and shorter flight time
✅ PASS: Bent swipe (right bow) -> curved lateral displacement to the right
✅ PASS: Overpower swipe (power > 0.92) -> flies over the crossbar
✅ PASS: Zone classification accurately bins goal points into 6 zones
✅ PASS: Goal trajectory continues behind goal line into the net
✅ PASS: pointToLaunch with takerAI.decideShot produces valid simulate trajectory without throwing
All 7 / 7 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Keeper AI (src/keeperAI.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Decide returns valid dive plan matching predicted zone
✅ PASS: Save succeeds when dive is correct and ball is within glove reach volume
✅ PASS: Goal scored when keeper dives opposite to the shot direction
✅ PASS: High-speed blast to the extreme top corner beats the keeper even on correct dive
✅ PASS: High speed shot within reach results in parry deflection instead of catch
✅ PASS: Torso body capsule intercepts shot directed at keeper body
All 6 / 6 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Touch & Swipe Input (src/input.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Swipe starting in bottom 75% triggers onShoot with valid launch
✅ PASS: Swipe starting in top 25% (scoreboard area) is ignored
✅ PASS: PointerEvents set and release pointer capture
All 3 / 3 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Difficulty Mapping (src/difficulty.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: All 4 difficulty tiers (EASY, MEDIUM, HARD, HELL) are defined with monotonic scaling
✅ PASS: getDifficultyConfig handles case-insensitivity and invalid fallback
✅ PASS: Gaze hint is only enabled for HARD and HELL difficulties
✅ PASS: keeperAI.decide directly consumes difficulty config keeperReactTime and scales reach
All 4 / 4 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Taker AI (src/takerAI.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Taker learns player dive habit and aims away from anticipated dive
✅ PASS: Early keeper dive is immediately punished by shooting to the open side
✅ PASS: Hell difficulty frequently snipes extreme corners with high speed
✅ PASS: Dive probability distribution sums to 1.0 and has non-negative values
All 4 / 4 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Taunts & Tells (src/taunts.js) Unit Tests ---
✅ PASS: Category KEEPER_READS_HABIT contains lines
✅ PASS: Category KEEPER_PREDICTS_SWITCH contains lines
